{"3046540":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"10 Second Mixtape","steam_appid":3046540,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"dlc":[5425970],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/ea090887ddb6f424351b9b302903fba6.poster.avif?t=1795765022\" width=1164 height=646 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/ea090887ddb6f424351b9b302903fba6.webm?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/ea090887ddb6f424351b9b302903fba6.mp4?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎹 🎸 🥁 🎤  Make mini music with other players!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Second Mixtape is a casual game about making super-short, super-fun songs using tiny loops created by you and other real people from all over the world. All of the thousands of songs in the game are 100% player-made!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry if you're not musically inclined! Making music is as easy as tapping a key on your keyboard. There are no wrong notes! No, seriously! 🙆‍♂️ No winners or losers here - it's all about having fun and making silly sounds. 🎵<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/0d024d2fbf7fc7a0ad7f39142d339428.poster.avif?t=1795765022\" width=1164 height=646 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/0d024d2fbf7fc7a0ad7f39142d339428.webm?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/0d024d2fbf7fc7a0ad7f39142d339428.mp4?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👨‍🎤🧑‍🎤👩‍🎤🔊  Watch other bands!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Infinite Venue is where you can watch and rate other players' bands! Your cheers and boos will affect how often that band is booked for shows for everyone else. The playlist is never-ending, and your creations will show up here, too!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Songs are also shareable through our website, so anyone (whether they have the game or not!) can hear and save your tracks. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/fbaf7d847075f6d8783a4d629dd163fe.poster.avif?t=1795765022\" width=1164 height=646 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/fbaf7d847075f6d8783a4d629dd163fe.webm?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/fbaf7d847075f6d8783a4d629dd163fe.mp4?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎟️Get the Backstage Pass DLC<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 12 additional instruments and more advanced song creation tools. These tools give you full control over the track arrangement and also allow you to collaborate  with other players in real-time!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock on! 🤙 <\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/ea090887ddb6f424351b9b302903fba6.poster.avif?t=1795765022\" width=1164 height=646 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/ea090887ddb6f424351b9b302903fba6.webm?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/ea090887ddb6f424351b9b302903fba6.mp4?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎹 🎸 🥁 🎤  Make mini music with other players!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Second Mixtape is a casual game about making super-short, super-fun songs using tiny loops created by you and other real people from all over the world. All of the thousands of songs in the game are 100% player-made!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry if you're not musically inclined! Making music is as easy as tapping a key on your keyboard. There are no wrong notes! No, seriously! 🙆‍♂️ No winners or losers here - it's all about having fun and making silly sounds. 🎵<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/0d024d2fbf7fc7a0ad7f39142d339428.poster.avif?t=1795765022\" width=1164 height=646 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/0d024d2fbf7fc7a0ad7f39142d339428.webm?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/0d024d2fbf7fc7a0ad7f39142d339428.mp4?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👨‍🎤🧑‍🎤👩‍🎤🔊  Watch other bands!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Infinite Venue is where you can watch and rate other players' bands! Your cheers and boos will affect how often that band is booked for shows for everyone else. The playlist is never-ending, and your creations will show up here, too!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Songs are also shareable through our website, so anyone (whether they have the game or not!) can hear and save your tracks. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/fbaf7d847075f6d8783a4d629dd163fe.poster.avif?t=1795765022\" width=1164 height=646 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/fbaf7d847075f6d8783a4d629dd163fe.webm?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/extras\/fbaf7d847075f6d8783a4d629dd163fe.mp4?t=1795765022\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎟️Get the Backstage Pass DLC<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 12 additional instruments and more advanced song creation tools. These tools give you full control over the track arrangement and also allow you to collaborate  with other players in real-time!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock on! 🤙 <\/p>","short_description":"Make mini music with other people online! A creative, low-stress game with async co-creation. Make unique songs with crazy instruments, or just hang out and watch other players' bands take the stage!","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Malay","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/627068ae2aa3a7df5c1312d3d20c72acc4f44cb2\/header.jpg?t=1795765022","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3046540\/162a